{"title":"밤을 달리다","artist":"YOASOBI","sourceId":"reference:gTd5qnpJgN7hsOky2Qpr","sourceHash":"27f018a34a34ce672f62781f5b0e8e7bda0bfa5549c2baff2f7b1bb62b822615","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":1.52,"end":4.52,"text":"沈むように溶けてゆくように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":9.02,"end":12.02,"text":"二人だけの空が広がる夜に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":31.44,"end":34.26,"text":"「さよなら」だけだった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":34.26,"end":37.26,"text":"その一言で全てが分かった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":37.87,"end":40.87,"text":"日が沈み出した空と君の姿","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":42.29,"end":45.29,"text":"フェンス越しに重なっていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":46.28,"end":48.92,"text":"初めて会った日から","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":48.92,"end":51.92,"text":"僕の心の全てを奪った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":52.82,"end":55.82,"text":"どこか儚い空気を纏う君は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":57.08,"end":60.08,"text":"寂しい目をしてたんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":60.58,"end":62.2,"text":"いつだってチックタックと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":62.2,"end":64.0,"text":"鳴る世界で何度だってさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":64.0,"end":66.57,"text":"触れる心無い言葉うるさい声に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":66.57,"end":68.73,"text":"涙が零れそうでも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":68.73,"end":71.73,"text":"ありきたりな喜びきっと二人なら見つけられる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":75.37,"end":78.37,"text":"騒がしい日々に笑えない君に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":79.32,"end":82.32,"text":"思い付く限り眩しい明日を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":82.85,"end":85.85,"text":"明けない夜に落ちてゆく前に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":86.45,"end":89.45,"text":"僕の手を掴んでほら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":89.58,"end":92.58,"text":"忘れてしまいたくて閉じ込めた日々も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":94.07,"end":97.07,"text":"抱きしめた温もりで溶かすから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":97.56,"end":100.56,"text":"怖くないよいつか日が昇るまで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":101.97,"end":104.97,"text":"二人でいよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":118.46000000000001,"end":120.82,"text":"君にしか見えない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":120.82,"end":123.82,"text":"何かを見つめる君が嫌いだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":124.51,"end":127.51,"text":"見惚れているかのような恋するような","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":128.95,"end":131.95,"text":"そんな顔が嫌いだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":132.64,"end":134.58,"text":"信じていたいけど信じれないこと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":134.58,"end":136.45,"text":"そんなのどうしたってきっと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":136.45,"end":138.19,"text":"これからだって いくつもあって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":138.19,"end":139.93,"text":"そのたんび怒って 泣いていくの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":139.93,"end":142.93,"text":"それでもきっといつかはきっと 僕らはきっと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":142.99,"end":145.99,"text":"分かり合えるさ 信じてるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":160.73,"end":163.28,"text":"もう嫌だって疲れたんだって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":163.28,"end":166.28,"text":"がむしゃらに差し伸べた 僕の手を振り払う君","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":168.35,"end":170.63,"text":"もう嫌だって 疲れたよなんて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":170.63,"end":173.63,"text":"本当は僕も言いたいんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":174.97,"end":176.77,"text":"Ah ほらまたチックタックと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":176.77,"end":178.55,"text":"鳴る世界で何度だってさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":178.55,"end":181.55,"text":"君の為に用意した言葉 どれも届かない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":181.86,"end":184.16,"text":"「終わりにしたい」 だなんてさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":184.16,"end":186.45,"text":"釣られて言葉にした時","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":186.45,"end":189.45,"text":"君は初めて笑った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":191.56,"end":194.56,"text":"騒がしい日々に笑えなくなっていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":195.42,"end":198.42,"text":"僕の目に映る君は綺麗だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":199.19,"end":202.19,"text":"明けない夜に零れた涙も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":202.93,"end":205.93,"text":"君の笑顔に溶けていく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":208.15,"end":211.15,"text":"変わらない日々に泣いていた僕を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":212.14,"end":215.14,"text":"君は優しく終わりへと誘う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":215.88,"end":218.88,"text":"沈むように溶けてゆくように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":219.32999999999998,"end":222.32999999999998,"text":"染み付いた霧が晴れる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":222.42000000000002,"end":225.42000000000002,"text":"忘れてしまいたくて閉じ込めた日々に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":226.74,"end":229.74,"text":"差し伸べてくれた君の手を取る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":230.4,"end":233.4,"text":"涼しい風が空を泳ぐように今 吹き抜けていく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":237.28,"end":240.28,"text":"繋いだ手を離さないでよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":240.87,"end":243.87,"text":"二人いま 夜に駆け出していく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}